n able reproduce the error in a class.\nYes markupEnabled is set to true.\n\n```\nbitmapfont.setMarkupEnabled(boolean markup)\n```\n\nIf I set it to false the font behaves like it should (disappears and appears again).\nWas the behavoir of that method changed? Some days ago it worked setting it to true. Indeed it also worked that way one year ago.\nFrom the docs I would assume that if markup ist set to false the font shouldnt be tinted, but\n\n```\ntextbuttonStyle.fontColor.set(...)\n```\n\nchanges the color of the font, even if it's set to false.\nIf it's set to true you cant change the color after the first time draw() was called in the actor.\nSame happens for Labels (obvious).\n\n```\n    private static void labelTest(Stage stage) {\n        BitmapFont font = new BitmapFont(\n                Gdx.files\n                        .external((\".mineforce/default/generated-fonts/openSans_regular.fnt\")));\n        font.setMarkupEnabled(true); //remove this line and it works\n        LabelStyle ls = new LabelStyle(font, Color.BLACK);\n\n        Label tb1 = new Label(\"FAILS\", ls);\n\n        tb1.addAction(Actions.alpha(0));\n        tb1.addAction(Actions.delay(1, Actions.alpha(1)));\n\n        tb1.setPosition(Gdx.graphics.getWidth() / 2,\n                Gdx.graphics.getHeight() / 2, Align.center);\n        stage.addActor(tb1);\n    }\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgdx/libgdx/issues/comments/58327695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Phibedy","id":1841954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDE5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1841954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Phibedy","html_url":"https://github.com/Phibedy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Phibedy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Phi